Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.61,0:00:58.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去海滩度假最舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:58.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ain't nothin' like a getaway at the beach
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.20,0:00:59.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧  闺蜜帮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:00:59.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right, Gal Pals?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.37,0:01:01.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那还用说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:01.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You said it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爸整个周末都在逼我做那破家务活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My dad's been making me do stupid chores all weekend
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有一大堆衣服没洗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I still have a load of laundry left
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me help
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.67,0:01:12.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,洗好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:12.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All done
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,立刻离开这片海滩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Clear this beach at once
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.97,0:01:22.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里不是公共海滩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:22.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't this a public beach?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.22,0:01:23.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:23.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.27,0:01:26.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里是我的私人财产
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:26.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is my private property
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:27.81,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(968,228)}私人
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.98,0:01:30.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在  我要放出猎犬虫咬你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:30.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now, I'm siccing my worm-hounds on you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.49,0:01:36.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:36.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.91,0:01:42.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们怎么把我家攻击性极强的恶犬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:42.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you turn my vicious attack hounds
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.62,0:01:45.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感化成可爱小狗的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:45.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,into lovable puppies?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.16,0:01:48.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们只是用了友情的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:48.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just used the power of friendship
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.29,0:01:52.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来没听过这个友情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:52.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of this friend-ship
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:52.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1262,920)}船
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.88,0:01:55.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比我的船还大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:55.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is it bigger than my ship?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.68,0:02:01.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  她不知道友情是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:01.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, she doesn't know what friendship is?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.60,0:02:04.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我们应该请她跟我们交朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:04.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should invite her to be our friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.27,0:02:06.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她是女的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.27,0:02:06.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, she is a gal
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.14,0:02:08.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以当闺蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:08.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And she could be a pal
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.48,0:02:10.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给她一次机会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:10.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's give her a shot
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.86,0:02:13.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上流小姐  要不今天跟我们一起来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:13.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lady Upturn, why don't you hang out with us today?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.65,0:02:16.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们可以给你展现友情的真谛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:16.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can show you what friendship is all about
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.53,0:02:19.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样对我有什么好处
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.53,0:02:19.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And how would that benefit me?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.41,0:02:22.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经富得流油了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:22.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am already obscenely wealthy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.99,0:02:25.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,友情可以建立一种不一样的财富
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:25.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, friendship builds a different kind of wealth
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.95,0:02:27.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,精神财富
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:27.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,emotional wealth
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.12,0:02:33.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我确实喜欢让投资组合多样点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:33.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do like to diversify my portfolio
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.46,0:02:37.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  我就试试看这个友情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:37.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, I shall give this friendship a try
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.93,0:02:45.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:45.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.27,0:02:49.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然我加入了  你们的管家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:49.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm here, where are your butlers?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.52,0:02:53.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁来用巨大棕榈叶给我们扇风
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:53.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who is going to fan us with big palm leaves?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.02,0:02:54.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们用不着那种玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:54.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't need any of that stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.94,0:02:56.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们有彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:56.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have each other
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要柠檬水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lemonade?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.49,0:03:03.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是想不到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:03.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I never
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自己居然会这么喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,thought I'd actually enjoy this
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来友情也不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Friendship isn't so bad, I see
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Heads up
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.17,0:03:14.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:14.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里下手比较没轻没重
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry doesn't know his own strength
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我手劲可重了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.05,0:03:23.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冒犯到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.05,0:03:23.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am offended
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.59,0:03:25.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别急  上流
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:25.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Easy there, Upturn
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.26,0:03:28.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别觉得冒犯  不如来扳回一城
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:28.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Instead of getting offended, I say we get even
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.48,0:03:39.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:39.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.90,0:03:43.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给你一万  你回网后面去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:43.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll give you ten grand to go back over the net
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.99,0:03:48.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  跟朋友玩就得靠团队合作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:48.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you use teamwork when you play with your friends
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.29,0:03:49.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你示范一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:49.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll show you how it's done
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.68,0:04:03.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:03.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看起来挺有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That looks rather fun
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.43,0:04:09.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一轮决定胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:09.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next round takes it all
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.82,0:04:28.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闺蜜帮赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:28.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gal Pals win
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入团队
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the team
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.45,0:04:33.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加油  闺蜜帮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:33.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, Gal Pals
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:34.21,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(546,638)}闺蜜帮
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.23,0:04:59.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我们在海滩玩得最开心的一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:59.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This has been the most fun we've ever had at the beach
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.94,0:05:03.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,难受到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:03.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I am offended
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.69,0:05:07.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我居然直到今天才交上这么棒的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:07.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that I never had such great friends until today
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,敬友情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To friendship
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.12,0:05:18.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么接下来要做什么刺激的友情活动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:17.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, what exciting friendship activity
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:18.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are we all doing next?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.96,0:05:22.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚是很快乐  但现在我们得回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, this has been fun
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:22.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but we actually gotta head home now
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们明天都得工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We all gotta work tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Work?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.80,0:05:29.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就不能花钱雇佣别人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:29.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't you just pay others to do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.01,0:05:33.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你很有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.01,0:05:33.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's rich
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.52,0:05:34.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:34.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Literally
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.06,0:05:37.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总之再见了  上流
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:37.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anyway, see ya later, Upturn
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.31,0:05:42.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:42.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, see you around
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,后会有期
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at some point
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.24,0:05:49.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:49.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let us hang
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  上流小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Lady Upturn
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很想玩  但
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd love to but--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.33,0:05:58.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得收拾这些破坚果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.33,0:05:58.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I gotta wrangle these dang nuts now
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.71,0:06:01.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:01.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.05,0:06:12.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,眼睛看着前方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:12.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,eyes in front
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.51,0:06:13.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明白  老师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:13.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有辆豪车
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A limo
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.82,0:06:24.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:24.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Over here
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.69,0:06:28.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,眼睛看路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:28.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eyes on the road
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:36.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1720,418)}花钱就来\N上流百货
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想来一起玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you wish to hang out?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I already am
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:44.25,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(704,784)}海之霸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:48.17,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(958,440)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.46,0:06:48.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果我弄不到秘方  就谁都不准拥有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:48.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I can't have the secret formula, no one can
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.26,0:06:50.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,炸了他们  凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:50.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blast 'em, Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.72,0:06:52.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正在启动死亡射线
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:52.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Activating death ray
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:54.47,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1746,452)}发射
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.85,0:07:01.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:01.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.48,0:07:02.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:02.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your friend
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.91,0:07:14.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦  要不要一起来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:14.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen, shall we commence hanging out?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.91,0:07:18.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个  我现在还得收拾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:18.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have a little cleaning up to do right now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.96,0:07:20.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  上流
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:20.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Upturn
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.71,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1400,556)}高中
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.09,0:07:32.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珍珍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:32.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.43,0:07:36.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来跟我这新朋友一起来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:36.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come hang out with your new friend, me
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.68,0:07:37.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:37.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.85,0:07:39.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:39.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.35,0:07:40.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她还不能走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:40.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She can't leave
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.89,0:07:44.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胡言乱语课还没上完
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:44.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of gibberish class
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.52,0:07:46.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:46.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aww, man
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.90,0:07:54.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜我现在完全没人陪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:54.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alas, I am utterly alone
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.87,0:07:56.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:56.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Indeed, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.45,0:08:00.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太不公平了  我明明交了新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:08:00.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not fair that I earned all my new friends
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.33,0:08:04.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,却不能跟她们共度时光
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:04.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and yet I cannot spend any time with them
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.33,0:08:06.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无疑  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:06.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Indubitably, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.09,0:08:13.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以利用我广大的资源
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:13.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can just use my vast resources
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逼她们按我的意愿做事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to make them do what I want
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.85,0:08:19.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备夜间直升机
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:19.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prepare the night-copter
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绝妙的主意  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excellent idea, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.67,0:08:48.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.67,0:08:48.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.34,0:08:50.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:50.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.71,0:08:53.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的私人小岛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:53.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my private island
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.42,0:08:56.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我们想在海滩玩多少天都行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:56.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now we can have as many beach days as we want
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.59,0:08:58.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一辈子也行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:08:58.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forever
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你人真好  上流
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's real kind of you, Upturn
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.52,0:09:10.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我们不能背井离乡一直玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:09.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we can't just uproot our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:10.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to hang out all the time
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.86,0:09:15.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可你们既然是我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:15.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But if you're my friends
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.53,0:09:18.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么不想每天陪着我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:18.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,why wouldn't you want to be around me every single day?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.45,0:09:23.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你惹我们生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.45,0:09:23.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because you're ticking us off
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.58,0:09:29.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冒犯到你们了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:29.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're offended?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.25,0:09:33.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:33.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I suppose I understand
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.80,0:09:34.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:34.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.76,0:09:36.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:36.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You may go
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.60,0:09:46.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  上流
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.60,0:09:46.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Upturn
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.31,0:09:49.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,一星期后
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.36,0:09:53.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎回到裤头村排球赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:53.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to Bikini Bottom volleyball
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这次是决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the final match
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.69,0:09:58.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哥们帮对决闺蜜帮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.69,0:09:58.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Guy Gang versus the Gal Pals
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.28,0:10:02.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她们才四个队员  不占优势
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:02.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're at a disadvantage with only four players
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.16,0:10:03.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:03.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dangnabbit
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.54,0:10:05.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是能再来一个队员就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:05.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If only we had a fifth player
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是说像她那样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:09.25,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(822,634)}赏点朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.17,0:10:09.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,免费拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:09.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Free hugs?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要伙伴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Need a buddy?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.21,0:10:13.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要一起来玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:13.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wanna hang out?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,场上请求暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A timeout has been called
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.76,0:10:21.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  她们可太需要了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:21.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And, boy, do they need it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.72,0:10:23.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我抱一个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:23.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take one of them hugs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.22,0:10:25.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:25.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.56,0:10:27.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:27.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You really mean it?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure do
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.31,0:10:32.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就因为我们不能跟你共度所有时光
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.31,0:10:32.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just 'cause we can't spend all of our time with ya
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.19,0:10:35.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不代表我们一点时光都不想跟你共度
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:35.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,don't mean we don't wanna spend any of our time with ya
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.90,0:10:37.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一朝闺蜜帮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:37.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Once a Gal Pal
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一辈子闺蜜帮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Always a Gal Pal
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.91,0:10:44.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,友好到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:44.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am befriended
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.16,0:10:47.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起把他们打得落花流水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:47.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now let's go kick some butt
