Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:51.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eugene is on vacation, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.71,0:12:58.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想到引开那个谁的办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:58.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I know a way to distract "you know who"
