Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:48.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With every Chummy Combo Meal
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.64,0:13:50.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母玩具吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:50.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfish toy?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.47,0:13:55.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喜欢你的玩具就好  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:55.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like your toy, honey
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.56,0:13:58.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我们又不吃这家的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:58.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we are not eating this food
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.44,0:14:03.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它是我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:03.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's my best friend
