Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:43.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They aren't really free
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:43.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1092,920)}自 由
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.57,0:14:45.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得先买套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:45.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have to buy a combo meal
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.36,0:14:47.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是那个免费
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:47.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not that kind of free
