Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:54.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Calm down, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.76,0:15:55.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是自由市场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.76,0:15:55.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a free market
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.01,0:15:58.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板想卖什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:58.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton can sell whatever he wants
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.18,0:15:59.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不关你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:15:59.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.56,0:16:01.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以别操心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:01.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So just stay out of it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.48,0:16:06.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不能不操心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:06.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't stay out of it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.11,0:16:09.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要解救那些水母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:09.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those jellyfish must be freed
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.28,0:16:14.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝离开蟹堡王了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:14.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob has left the building
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.53,0:16:18.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他果然会忍不住去救水母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:18.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew he couldn't resist saving the jellyfish
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.58,0:16:23.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方已经是囊中之物了  凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:23.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The formula's in the bag, Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.25,0:16:25.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你跟我一样兴奋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:25.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you as excited as I am?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该睡觉了  比利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time for bed, Billy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.51,0:16:38.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天再玩你的新玩具吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:38.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you can play with your new toy tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.73,0:16:44.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  小水母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:44.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, little jellyfish
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.31,0:16:45.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这就救你出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:45.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm busting you outta here
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救了一只水母
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One jellyfish freed
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.50,0:17:07.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还剩九十三百千万亿无数亿只
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:07.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,93 zillion billion kazillion Brazilian left to go
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.38,0:17:57.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:57.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, little baby
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不是故意吵醒你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to wake you
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.56,0:18:07.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么偷我最爱的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:07.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you stealing my favorite toy?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.98,0:18:09.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:09.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.19,0:18:14.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是清理玩具的精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:14.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a toy cleaning elf
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.74,0:18:19.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:19.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.24,0:18:23.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:23.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.41,0:18:24.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不是精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:24.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not an elf
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.00,0:18:27.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是个煎炸厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:27.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a fry cook
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.25,0:18:29.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我希望你看看这只可怜的水母
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:29.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I want you to look at this poor jellyfish
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.00,0:18:33.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想象你被永远困在水晶球里会怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:33.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and imagine if you were stuck under glass forever
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.68,0:18:42.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来没那么想过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:42.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I never thought of it that way before
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.76,0:18:45.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  电电
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.76,0:18:45.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Zappers
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.90,0:18:52.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你救出所有水母吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:52.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I help you free all the jellyfish?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.73,0:18:53.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:53.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.78,0:19:00.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然庆祝胜利的一觉睡饱了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:19:00.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that I've had my victory nap
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.66,0:19:05.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就去蟹堡王一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:05.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I reckon I'll mosey on over to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把秘方抱回家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,fetch the formula
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.87,0:19:12.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我高兴得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:12.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm as giddy as a school boy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.21,0:19:15.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从来没这么自由自在过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:15.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never felt so free
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  蟑螂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, cockroach
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.30,0:19:21.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝叫我不准让人进来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:21.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob told me to keep everyone out
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.72,0:19:24.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,向后转  给我滚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:24.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so do an about-face and hit the road
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.97,0:19:28.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么对付这白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:28.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know how to deal with this moron
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.10,0:19:31.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁想吃冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:31.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who wants ice cream?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.86,0:19:35.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去捡  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:35.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get it, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.65,0:19:36.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去捡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:36.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get it
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.23,0:19:38.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,汪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:38.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bark
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.07,0:19:39.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,汪汪汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.07,0:19:39.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bark, bark, bark, bark
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来试试我的密码破解手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, to try my safe cracker
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.41,0:19:50.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它能几秒内试遍密码所有的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:48.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,which can try every possible safe combination
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.91,0:19:50.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in seconds flat
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.08,0:19:53.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿好鞋子  秘密配方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:53.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Put your shoes on, Secret Formula
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.83,0:19:55.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要去散散步了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:55.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we're going for a walk
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真乖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good boy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.14,0:20:11.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冰淇淋  你要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:11.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, ice cream, where ya goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:14.65,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,660)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.94,0:20:19.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那只蟑螂在偷东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:19.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The cockroach guy is stealing the thing
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.74,0:20:24.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,汪汪汪汪汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:24.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bark, bark, bark, bark, bark, bark
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.41,0:20:27.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方是我的  你这臭杂种
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.41,0:20:27.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The formula is mine, you mangy mongrel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:46.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(392,686)}小心凸块
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.60,0:20:52.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最后一只了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:52.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the last one
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.39,0:20:54.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母全都自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:54.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're all free
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.52,0:20:55.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:55.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Free
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.11,0:20:59.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,呼叫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.11,0:20:59.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Breaker
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.36,0:21:00.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:00.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.53,0:21:02.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请回答  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:02.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come in, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.03,0:21:03.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:03.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.36,0:21:04.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:04.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.15,0:21:07.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是打来想说  小心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:07.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just called to say, look out
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.54,0:21:11.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密配方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:11.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret Formula
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.83,0:21:13.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:13.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密配方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret Formula
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.33,0:21:21.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那只蟑螂引开了我  好偷到秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:19.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That cockroach distracted me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so he could steal the formula
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.46,0:21:24.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他也一样引开了我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:24.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He did the same thing to me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.59,0:21:25.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.59,0:21:25.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,立刻交出那个秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You hand over that formula this instant
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.26,0:21:28.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:28.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.93,0:21:29.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咬他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.93,0:21:29.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sic 'em
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.02,0:21:36.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这就交出来  给自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:36.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll hand it over, alright, to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.77,0:21:39.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们无能为力了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:39.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing you can do about it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.71,0:22:04.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板  那些水母说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.71,0:22:04.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton, those jellyfish are right
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.67,0:22:06.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许你需要待在里面一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.67,0:22:06.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,maybe you need to stay in there a while
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.68,0:22:08.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,长长记性
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.68,0:22:08.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to teach you a lesson
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.05,0:22:11.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  我来对付他
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.05,0:22:11.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll take care of him
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.85,0:22:16.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.85,0:22:16.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.60,0:22:17.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要她
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.60,0:22:17.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not her
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.44,0:22:18.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,千万别是她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:18.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything but her
